    "Item allocations are missing or incomplete. Unknown delivery value remains pending; only explicit item refunds or cancellations are counted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Item allocations are missing or incomplete. Unknown delivery value remains pending; only explicit item refunds or cancellations are counted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "商品金额分配缺失或不完整。无法确定的交付金额仍列为待交付，仅计算明确标记的商品退款或取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Net delivered value is prorated from exact item amounts and quantities, excluding refunded and cancelled lines.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Net delivered value is prorated from exact item amounts and quantities, excluding refunded and cancelled lines."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实际交付金额按准确的商品金额与数量比例计算，不含已退款和已取消的商品。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How Keyvow counts value": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How Keyvow counts value"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "键诺如何计算金额"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Charged is the gross order amount. A cancelled or fully refunded order moves its full amount to that category. For partial outcomes, only line items explicitly marked refunded or cancelled contribute their recorded line amounts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Charged is the gross order amount. A cancelled or fully refunded order moves its full amount to that category. For partial outcomes, only line items explicitly marked refunded or cancelled contribute their recorded line amounts."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "订单金额是订单总额。已取消或全额退款的订单，其全部金额会归入相应类别。部分退款或取消时，只计入明确标记商品的已记录金额。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Net delivered value excludes confirmed refunds and cancellations. Delivered orders without line items use the remaining order amount. With items, Keyvow prorates delivered quantities only when every line has a nonnegative amount and all line amounts add up exactly to the order total; otherwise unknown value stays pending.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Net delivered value excludes confirmed refunds and cancellations. Delivered orders without line items use the remaining order amount. With items, Keyvow prorates delivered quantities only when every line has a nonnegative amount and all line amounts add up exactly to the order total; otherwise unknown value stays pending."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实际交付金额不含已确认的退款和取消。没有商品明细的已交付订单使用剩余订单金额；有商品明细时，只有每项金额均非负且合计与订单总额完全一致，键诺才按交付数量比例计算，否则无法确定的金额仍列为待交付。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refund requested or disputed shows the remaining unresolved order value separately. It is not a confirmed refund and can coexist with delivered value because no requested refund amount is stored.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refund requested or disputed shows the remaining unresolved order value separately. It is not a confirmed refund and can coexist with delivered value because no requested refund amount is stored."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已申请退款或争议中的订单会单独显示尚未解决的金额。由于未保存申请退款金额，它不属于已确认退款，并可与已交付金额同时存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each currency has its own ledger. Keyvow never invents an exchange rate, refund amount, or combined total.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each currency has its own ledger. Keyvow never invents an exchange rate, refund amount, or combined total."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每种货币都有独立账目。键诺不会凭空生成汇率、退款金额或跨币种合计。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a Keyvow JSON or ZIP backup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
