            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已解锁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The free version includes up to 3 active orders. Keyvow Pro is an optional, one-time lifetime upgrade with unlimited active orders. Your existing orders, evidence, backups, CSV exports, PDF reports, and restore remain available in both versions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The free version includes up to 3 active orders. Keyvow Pro is an optional, one-time lifetime upgrade with unlimited active orders. Your existing orders, evidence, backups, CSV exports, PDF reports, and restore remain available in both versions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "免费版最多可保留 3 笔进行中订单。键诺 Pro 是可选的一次性终身升级，可创建不限数量的进行中订单。两个版本都保留现有订单、证据、备份、CSV 导出、PDF 报告和恢复功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
