    "An order without line items can be marked Delivered directly. With items, Delivered is derived when every noncancelled item has its full quantity delivered. Any shipped or partially delivered item otherwise keeps the order partially shipped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An order without line items can be marked Delivered directly. With items, Delivered is derived when every noncancelled item has its full quantity delivered. Any shipped or partially delivered item otherwise keeps the order partially shipped."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有商品明细的订单可直接标记为已交付。有商品明细时，只有所有未取消商品的全部数量均已交付，订单才会标记为已交付；否则，只要有商品已发货或部分交付，订单就保持部分发货状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
