    "Keyvow Pro is a one-time lifetime upgrade with unlimited active orders. The free version keeps up to 3 active orders; your existing orders, evidence, exports, and backups remain available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keyvow Pro is a one-time lifetime upgrade with unlimited active orders. The free version keeps up to 3 active orders; your existing orders, evidence, exports, and backups remain available."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "键诺 Pro 是一次买断的终身升级，可创建不限数量的进行中订单。免费版最多保留 3 个进行中订单；现有订单、证据、导出和备份始终可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keyvow Pro is not available for purchase right now. Your orders, evidence, exports, and backups remain fully available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keyvow Pro is not available for purchase right now. Your orders, evidence, exports, and backups remain fully available."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "键诺 Pro 目前无法购买。你的订单、证据、导出和备份仍完整可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keyvow could not open its shared local inbox. Please try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keyvow could not open its shared local inbox. Please try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "键诺无法打开共享本地收件箱，请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keyvow only asks for notification access after your explicit action. Reminder changes are saved even when system notifications are unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keyvow only asks for notification access after your explicit action. Reminder changes are saved even when system notifications are unavailable."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "键诺只会在你明确操作后请求通知权限。即使系统通知不可用，提醒更改也会保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keyvow organizes dates and documents. It does not determine dispute eligibility, file disputes, or guarantee recovery. Verify current rules with your payment provider.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keyvow organizes dates and documents. It does not determine dispute eligibility, file disputes, or guarantee recovery. Verify current rules with your payment provider."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "键诺用于整理日期和文档，不判定争议资格、不发起争议，也不保证追回款项。请向支付服务商核实当前规则。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keyvow saves this wording with the purchase milestone. Later updates will not rewrite the original promise. Approximate estimates use the end of their range for attention, not a fake exact-day promise.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keyvow saves this wording with the purchase milestone. Later updates will not rewrite the original promise. Approximate estimates use the end of their range for attention, not a fake exact-day promise."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "键诺会将这段原文保存在购买里程碑中，后续更新不会改写原始承诺。大致预计以区间结束时间提醒关注，不会伪装成精确到某一天的承诺。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
